+## `PATCH /:account_slug/notifications/bundle_email_frequency`
+
+Sets how often notification emails are bundled for the current user. Instead of one email per notification, notifications are batched into a time window and sent as a single email when the window closes. The window starts when the first notification in it arrives.
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `bundle_email_frequency` | string | Yes | One of `never`, `every_few_hours` (4 hours), `daily`, or `weekly` |
+
+__Response:__
+
+Redirects to the notification settings page on success. Returns `422 Unprocessable Entity` for an unknown frequency.
